  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the end of three years from the date of this permission.\r\n\r\nReason: In order to comply with the provisions of Section 91 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).\r\n\r\n",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans \r\n\r\n2340.1 Design Planning and Heritage Statement, 2340.1-SK-20C Proposed Front Elevations, 2340.1-SK-16B Proposed Ground Floor Plan, 2340.1-EX-14 Existing Site Photos, 2340.1-EX-13A Existing Site Photos, 2340.1-EX-06A Existing  Front Elevations 2340.1-EX-02 Existing  Ground Floor Plan, 2340.1-EX-00 Existing Site and Location Plan\r\n\r\nReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interest of proper planning.\r\n",
    "Condition : 3 - Before the relevant part of the work is begun, detailed drawings in respect of the following external works shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority. \r\n\r\nFully annotated detailed drawings should be provided at a scale of 1:10 (or as appropriate) and where applicable, shall be supplemented with product information/manufacturers' specifications: - \r\na)          Proposed sliding gate\r\nb)          Proposed pedestrian gate\r\n \r\nReason: To safeguard the appearance of the premises and the character of the immediate area in accordance with the requirements of policies D1 and D2 of the London Borough of Camden Local Plan 2017."
